# ML-P1 Founder Delegated Authority (v2026-07-23)

Canonical: `command-center/docs/governance/FOUNDER_DELEGATED_AUTHORITY_POLICY.md`  
Next-phase queue: `command-center/docs/governance/ML-P1_NEXT_PHASE_PRIORITIES.md`

## Auto-continue (do not pause Founder)

- Peer reviews APPROVE/PASS after remediation
- Migration checksums match frozen apply-packet SHA
- Synthetic prod validation PASS (**no real-customer mutations**)
- Inside ratified PDs, this policy, or Next-Phase Priorities

**Pipeline:** PR → 3-round review → **auto-merge on CI green** → A3 migrations → synth validation → Hostinger → ledger/evidence → next priority.

## Escalate only for Major Decisions

1. Pricing/discount **> ±3%** on active service  
2. Net-new customer-facing flows (portal, autopay, etc.)  
3. Invoice **auto-send or auto-charge ON** for real customers  
4. Drop columns/tables or rewrite historical financials  
5. Contract / regulatory / data-residency  
6. Prod validation FAIL on money/auth/integrity (unhotfixable)  
7. Cost > 4 dev-days or third-party spend > $300  
8. Scope change · new payment rails · breaking PD/Security invariants  

## Post–Slice 6 priority order

1. Mobile Inspections (**S8**) — `/inspections/*`, offline sync, `inspection-sync`  
2. Photo Bundles — reorder albums + email links + S3 prefix  
3. Analytics — `/analytics` read-only RPCs + export  
4. Global UX/IA — nav order, breadcrumbs, + Create, mobile bar  
5. Settings typed UI — `settings.billing_*` / jobs / pricing (auto-charge stays OFF)  
6. Nightly regression — fixtures + Stripe **sandbox** only  

S7 = reserved follow-up/warranty (do not jump ahead without queue clearance).

## Defaults

- Non-major → HCP-consistent, lower re-work, no ask  
- Never enable auto-send/auto-charge without #3  
- Never drop/rewrite historical money without #4  
